==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|}}, from {{inh|de|goh|wuosti||waste}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*wōstī||desolate, waste}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/vyːst/}}
* {{audio|de|De-wüst.ogg|Audio}}

===Adjective===
{{de-adj|er|wüstesten}}

